    <entry>
        <title>There&#x27;s a Certain Slant of Light</title>
        <author>
            <name>Jujube</name>
        </author>
        <link href="https://www.jujubemonster.com/theres-a-certain-slant-of-light.html"/>
        <id>https://www.jujubemonster.com/theres-a-certain-slant-of-light.html</id>
        <media:content url="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/165/lightwoman.png" medium="image" />
            <category term="poetry"/>

        <updated>2026-10-18T12:15:41-07:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/165/lightwoman.png" alt="portrait of a yound woman" />
                    There's a certain Slant of light, Winter Afternoons - That oppresses, like the Heft Of Cathedral Tunes - Heavenly Hurt, it gives us - We can find no scar, But internal difference - Where the Meanings, are - — Emily Dickinson
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/165/lightwoman.png" class="type:primaryImage" alt="portrait of a yound woman" /></p>
                <p>There's a certain Slant of light, <br>Winter Afternoons - <br>That oppresses, like the Heft <br>Of Cathedral Tunes - </p>
<p>Heavenly Hurt, it gives us - <br>We can find no scar, <br>But internal difference - <br>Where the Meanings, are -</p>
<p>— Emily Dickinson</p>
<figure class="post__image"><img loading="lazy"  src="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/165/lightwoman-2.png" alt="" width="500" height="663"></figure>
            ]]>
        </content>
    </entry>
